 "strings": {
  "Amane-san asked me to protect Hiyama, a man who she foresaw a fire calamity befalling. She said the presence of the calamity has grown massive, and that this was the first time something like this happened. But it turned out that the catalyst of the fire calamity was Hiyama himself, a wanted arsonist who planned on turning Kamurocho into a sea of of fire. I was able to stop it, but I'm not doubting Amane-san's powers as much anymore...": "",
  "A request from Yukako Oki. Her boyfriend, Mamoru Shimazu, hasn't responded to her texts and she believes something must have happened to him. I think she's overreacting, but a job's a job.": "",
  "A request from Yukako Oki. Her boyfriend, Mamoru Shimazu, hasn't responded to her texts and she believes something must have happened to him. I thought she was overreacting, and I was right, because it turned out Shimazu-san wasn't missing, he was just making preparations for Yukako-san's birthday. Yukako-san's favorite pop idol, Toya Tokunaga was called in as a surprise but, as usual, the wind blew his wig away...": "",
  "Tokunaga's wig was blown away again. His career as an idol depends on it.": "",
  "Tokunaga's wig was blown away again. His career as an idol depends on it. I managed to get it back, but I'm really not interested in doing this again...": "",
  "Tokunaga's wig was blown away for the third time. This is the worst wig ever. I have to get it back before it flies away again!": "",
  "Apparently Tokunaga's wig was blown away again and some yakuza accidentally took it as his own. Can I get it back without causing a scene? Stay tuned...": "",
  "Apparently Tokunaga's wig was blown away again and some yakuza accidentally took it as his own. The yakuza thought I wore a wig too, but what's important is that I got it back. And Tokunaga told me that he grew a single hair on his head. I guess where there's a will, there's a way...": "",
  "The leader of the burglary ring that's been making the rounds in Kamurocho, Crow, asked me to find Jester, one of their members. Crow told me he's worried about Jester. I owe Jester, too. I'll go to where he appeared last time and look for clues.": "",
  "The leader of the burglary ring that's been making the rounds in Kamurocho, Crow, asked me to find Jester, one of their members. Crow told me he's worried about Jester, but it was a lie, because Crow simply wanted Jester to come back to the thieves to make use of his talents for his vile schemes.": "",
  "The owner of Tender called me up because people at the bar are betting on who can guess Mari's occupation, and they want me to take a stab at it. Mari is a regular at Tender, but her life is shrouded in mystery. I don't even know her real name. I'm curious myself, so I decided to join in on the bet.": "",
  "The owner of Tender called me up because people at the bar are betting on who can guess Mari's occupation and they want me to take a stab at it. Mari is a regular at Tender, but her life is shrouded in mystery. I don't even know her real name. I'm curious myself, so I decided to join in on the bet.": "",
  "The owner of Tender called me up because people at the bar are betting on who can guess Mari's occupation and they want me to take a stab at it. Mari is a regular at Tender, but her life is shrouded in mystery. I don't even know her real name. I was curious myself, so I decided to join in on the bet, only to discover Mari was a gambler. We were gambling against a professional gambler. No wonder she was excited.": "",
  "Kaito-san asked me to find Yusuke-kun's father. Apparently Kaito-san stopped a bunch of thugs from kidnapping him. Yusuke-kun thinks that Kaito is some kind of superhero and Kaito doesn't know what to do. I bet Yusuke-kun would be shocked if he finds out that Kaito used to be yakuza.": "",
  "Kaito-san asked me to find Yusuke-kun's father. Apparently Kaito-san stopped a bunch of thugs from kidnapping him. Yusuke-kun thinks that Kaito is some kind of hero of justice and Kaito doesn't know what to do. I bet Yusuke-kun would be shocked if he finds out that Kaito used to be yakuza.": "",
  "Kaito-san asked me to find Yusuke-kun's father. Apparently Kaito-san stopped a bunch of thugs from kidnapping Yusuke-kun. Yusuke-kun thinks that Kaito is some kind of hero of justice and Kaito doesn't know what to do. Fortunately, we were able to find Yusuke-kun's father and managed to save them from the yakuza. Yusuke-kun thought Kaito was a hero until the very end.": "",
  "Genda-sensei asked me to be a bodyguard for one of his clients in a messy divorce case. The father is a former yakuza, and he's been desperately trying to get his daughter back. To make matters worse, the lawyer for the father is a man named Oikawa, a former student of Genda-sensei, who he fired. I've been told that Oikawa is a man who would do anything to win. I have to help Genda-sensei not as a lawyer, but as a detective.": "",
  "Genda-sensei asked me to be a bodyguard for one of his clients in a messy divorce case. The father is a former yakuza, and he's been desperately trying to get his daughter back. To make matters worse, the lawyer for the father is a man named Oikawa, a former student of Genda-sensei, who he fired. Oikawa tried to use fabricated evidence of an affair to win, but Genda-sensei's compassion dissolved the case itself. Trials aren't a game, and that's a valuable lesson we can all learn from Genda-sensei.": "",
  "The Pigeon Takes Flight": "",
  "It seems that they started hosting drone races in Kamurocho. I should join sometime. It could be fun. But that guy Makihara must really love drones. If I ever have any drone problems, I know where to go.": "",
  "Paradise VR Unlocked": "",
  "A homeless man with a bad leg gave me a play pass for \"Dice & Cube.\" He wants me to go and play the game in exchange for him looking for someone who knows something about Red Nose. I need to clear the game and bring him the prize.": "",
  "Tatsuro-san requested me to entertain his wife. His wife is very drunk and seems to think I'm her husband. I think she needs a doctor, not a detective, but what am I going to do? This is weird.": "",
  "Tatsuro-san requested me to entertain his wife. His wife appeared to be very drunk and seemed to think I'm her husband. I think she needs a doctor, not a detective, especially considering Tatsuro-san jumped out at the end and she fainted.": "",
  "Damn it! I've been ripped off! A married couple, Tatsuo and Maki, pretended to be good people, but planned on ripping me off from the start. I lost 10,000 yen. I'm coming to get my money back!": "",
  "Damn it! I've been ripped off! A married couple, Tatsuo and Maki, pretended to be good people, but planned on ripping me off from the start. I lost 100,000 yen. I'm coming to get my money back!": "",
  "Damn it! I've been ripped off! A married couple, Tatsuo and Maki, pretended to be good people, but planned on ripping me off from the start. I was charged 100,000 yen, but I got it back. Despite her husband forbidding her, the woman who ripped me off was apparently going to a host club and had been spending all of the money there. All it took was proof.": "",
  "Hoshino-kun called me to defend him in the mysterious disappearance of some cake that Saori-san had been protecting. Hoshino-kun is the prime suspect, and I have to prove his innocence. And yes, a bunch of grown-ass lawyers are holding a trial to determine his fate over this cake.": "",
  "Hoshino-kun called me to defend him in the mysterious disappearance of some cake that Saori-san had been protecting. Hoshino-kun was the prime suspect, and I had to prove his innocence. Saori-san transforms into a different person when it comes to sweets, and she couldn't remember that there was a planned power outage that caused Genda-sensei, who was on cleaning duty, to throw out the spoiled cake. Hoshino-kun, you've got your work cut out for you.": "",
  "Taeko Nakahara asked me to get back her stolen diamond ring. It's a special ring given to her by her husband, and she wants it back no matter what before their wedding anniversary this weekend. I only have the suspect's face sketch as a clue, but if I can deduce what the suspect did after he stole the ring I should be able to figure it out.": "",
  "Taeko Nakahara asked me to get back her stolen diamond ring. It's a special ring given to her by her husband, and she wants it back no matter what before their wedding anniversary this weekend. I only have a sketch of the suspect as a clue, but if I can deduce what the suspect did after he stole the ring, I should be able to figure it out.": "",
  "Turns out the same guy was behind the Koi Bride sashimi and the ring robbery. There's a high chance Wakahara sliced up the koi and stole the ring. I still don't know what links these two cases, but if I follow this thread I might solve the mystery of the koi sashimi.": "",
  "It turns out the Koi Bride's sashimi case and the ring robbery were by the same suspect. There's a high chance Wakahara sliced up the carp and stole the ring. I still don't know what links these two cases, but if I continue with this investigation, I'll be able to figure out why the carps were turned into sashimi overnight.": "",
  "It turns out the Koi Bride's sashimi case and the ring robbery were committed by the same suspect. I wasn't sure what linked these two cases but I later found out that the carp made the mistake of swallowing the stolen ring, leading to their untimely deaths. Wakahara admitted to the crime.": "",
  "Nanami Matsuoka was kidnapped by her stalker! I only have a few clues. She's in a car, I have to find her before they get too far!": "",
  "Nanami Matsuoka-san was kidnapped by her stalker! I only have a few clues. She's in a car, I have to find her before they get too far!": "",
  "Nanami Matsuoka-san was kidnapped by her stalker! The stalker, Takeda, planned on kidnapping Nanami-san and imprisoning her. That was a close call, but I was able to save her.": "",
  "A request from Ono Michio's producer, Hironaka-san. Nishimura-kun, the part-timer who was wearing the costume, tossed it and ran away, and apparently someone picked up the costume and used it for a robbery.": "",
  "Nishimura-kun, the part-timer who was wearing the Ono Michio costume, tossed it and ran away, and apparently someone picked up the costume and used it for a robbery.": "",
  "Nishimura-kun, the part-timer who was wearing the Ono Michio costume, tossed it and ran away, and apparently someone picked up the costume and used it for a robbery. He seems to be in trouble. The culprit was a man named Kaneda, who feigned ignorance. His loans were due today, but with no way of paying them back, he took it upon himself to don the Ono Michio costume and commit robbery of 500,000 yen. He then ran straight to Charles where he handed off the money. This case definitely had me saying, \"oh no.\"": "",
  "I was asked by Sunada-san to conduct a infidelity investigation. Sunada-san is convinced that his girlfriend, Aoi-san, is cheating on him and he will commit suicide if his suspicions are true. It's a depressing investigation, but I guess I have no choice.": "",
  "I was asked by Sunada-san to conduct a infidelity investigation. Sunada-san was convinced that his girlfriend, Aoi-san is cheating on him and he threatened to commit suicide if it was true. And it was, of course. It turns out that Aoi-san was cheating, but the problem...? Should we call this a problem? Anyway, it was that she was cheating with this playboy scam artist who only targets women... Aoi-san was about to be scammed, but as soon as Sunada-san found out that the guy was an infamous scam artist the police were after, he remembered his duty as a cop... Or maybe he just wanted to save his love. All's well that ends well...": "",
  "Tatsuya Gamo, a prisoner who was kept in the Abashiri Prison for killing a gang member, recently escaped and is currently lurking somewhere in Kamurocho. I don't want anything to do with such a dangerous man but apparently there's a reward...": "",
  "Tatsuya Gamo, a prisoner who was kept in the Abashiri Prison for killing a gang member, recently escaped and is currently lurking somewhere in Kamurocho. I didn't want anything to do with him, but guess who found him. Gamo was much stronger than I thought he'd be, but I was able to hand him over to the police. I'm actually tempted to send him a hamburger.": "",
