  "Iyama's Extract Shop": "",
  "Infidelity Investigation": "",
  "My name Noriko Taguchi. My husband has started going out frequently recently and I want to know where he's going. It's hard to imagine that he's cheating on me, but could you investigate? Thank you.": "",
  "Entertainment Industry Job": "",
  "One of my agency's top talents has gotten entangled in quite a mess, so I'd like your assistance. I can't get down to your office, so would you mind coming to the 6th floor of Hotel New Deborah? I'll wait in the hallway. Please come at some point in the day, as I'm quite busy at night.": "",
  "There's a Panty Thief on the Loose!": "",
  "Not even the police can get this guy, so I'm asking you! He stole my sister's panties and now that he has her in his sights, I'm worried about what'll happen next. I'll wait at M Side Cafe with my sister. I'm the pretty boy with black, short hair, lol. My sister looks like me, but with longer hair.": "",
  "Where'd My Jacket Go?": "",
  "My special jacket has disappeared. It was given to me by my older brother, and it means a lot to me. It's my soul. More important than my life. Please find it as quickly as possible! I'll be waiting at Wild Jackson on Tenkaichi Street! If you see some gaudy guy with brown hair, gray jacket and red shirt, that's probably me. ": "",
  "There's a Groper on the Loose!": "",
  "Another pervert in the Twisted Trio has taken a liking to Tsukino. This one's a groper, and he already got a big handful of her ass. She can't even go outside without an escort. Please catch him, Yagami-san! I'll drop by your office.": "",
  "Searching for Missing Nephew": "",
  "Could you please search for my missing nephew? He left home three years ago saying he was going to become the number one host in Kamurocho, and I haven't heard from him since. His parents have long since passed away, and I am his only living relative. Please, help me. I will be waiting at M Side Cafe. Could you please look for a black-haired, middle-aged woman wearing a blue coat?": "",
  "Sexual Harassment Investigation": "",
  "I want you to get proof that my superior is sexually harassing me. I would prefer rock-solid evidence he can't weasel out of. However, my boss is the president's son, so I'm not sure how to handle this. I would like to consult you about this issue. I will be waiting at Café Mijore. I have black hair and uh, large breasts. Men don't have trouble spotting me.": "",
  "A Publisher's Request": "",
  "Greetings, Yagami-sama. I'm Kawada, and I'm contacting you today in hopes that you'll take on a rather odd request. Can we discuss this further at Café Mijore on Nakamichi Street? I'm a middle-aged, average looking man in a suit. Please come at your leisure.": "",
  "Another Mystery Event!": "",
  "Good day, Yagami-sama. This is Kawada from Cloudy Skies Publishing. Thank you for your help the other day. I have contacted you again in hopes to ask for your help once more. I'll await you at Café Mijore on Nakamichi Street. Could you please come by when you have time? Thank you.": "",
  "Why not pass some time?": "",
  "Good day, Yagami-san. It is Kawada from Cloudy Skies Publishing. Thank you for the other day! I'm sorry to keep asking you this, but I have another request for you, Yagami-san. I'll be waiting at Café Mijore on Nakamichi Street as usual. Could you please come when you have time? Thank you.": "",
  "Yagami-san, there's a golden mouse out in the wild, and he's worth a loooot of money. He'll have lots of pursuers, so we've got to move quickly. I'll wait for you on the roof of Stardust! It's easier to get up there from the building's next door neighbor's back entrance.": "",
  "Trigger all of the \"???\" events": "",
  "Defeat the Keihin Gang leaders.": "",
  "I have something kinda private to discuss, Yagami-san. I'll wait for you at M Side Cafe. Be discreet, okay?": "",
  "Second Infidelity Investigation": "",
  "I'd like to ask you to investigate if my husband is having an affair or not. I'd actually asked another detective to investigate, and he concluded that he wasn't, but something's not sitting right with me... So I'd like to get a second detective's opinion. I know where your office is, so I'll drop by shortly.": "",
  "My name is Ohata. I have an urgent request. I'll be waiting at Café Mijore at Nakamichi Street. Could you please come? Please look for a man in glasses wearing a brown jacket with green pants. Sorry for the inconvenience. Thank you.": "",
  "It's Ohata. Thank you for the other day. It happened again, and I'd like to leave it in your hands. I'll be waiting at Café Mijore at Nakamichi Street. Thank you.": "",
  "It's Ohata. Thanks for last time. I'm sorry, but can I ask you to do it again? I'll be waiting at Café Mijore as usual. Thank you.": "",
  "I need a photographer I can trust, and Yagami-san, you're the man. This one's kind of big, so can I save the details for later? Meet me at Beef Zone tonight, if you could. Thanks.": "",
  "<symbol=case_file_subhead> Befriend Hiranuma": "",
  "My name is Fuyuhiko Tanaka. I would like to talk to you about helping me look for someone. I'll be waiting at M Side Cafe, in a navy jacket with a purple shirt. Thank you.": "",
  "Ghost Capture Request": "",
  "I heard a rumor that a ghost appears in the apartment I plan to move in next month. No one said anything about that in the lease. Please capture the ghost to prove the place is haunted! Please come to Quadra Garden on the first floor of Hotel New Deborah at night. I'll be waiting, wearing a hoodie with a heart-mark on it.": "",
  "I Got Honey Trapped!": "",
  "I was tricked by a woman into a trap. Think you can find proof it was a trap? If not, my life is over. Please uncover that woman's evil true nature! Please, I'm begging you! I'll come by your office!": "",
  "So Much Murder": "",
  "Owner of Koi Bride": "",
  "I want you to solve a mystery that happened at my store. It's a murder, and it involves... dismemberment. I can't talk about this to the police for... reasons. That's why I want to leave it to your capable hands, great detective. Solve the mystery of this case and capture the true culprit. I'll be waiting in front of Koi Bride.": "",
  "Takayuki Yagami, I await you at Little Asia. Come.": "",
  "Clear 49 side cases.": "",
  "A Valuable Cat": "",
  "I want you to find a certain cat. It's a very special cat, but I can't seem to capture it. Please, you must do this. Additionally, I should mention that in case the contents of this request leaks to outsiders, a great danger may befall you. I ask you to please keep it a secret. Please come to the roof of the building that houses the izakaya called Happy Family on Senryo Avenue, and come alone.": "",
  "Background Investigation of My Son's Wife": "",
  "Please investigate whether or not my son's wife is trying to kill my son. Ever since my son got married, he's been struck with no shortage of misfortunes. I'm suspecting the wife has something to do with it. I'll be waiting at Café Alps, wearing a pink coat and jeans.": "",
  "Job Request": "",
  "I heard the Yagami Detective Agency is the best detective agency in Kamurocho from the master of Tender. Come to Hills Garden on Park Boulevard.": "",
